---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile, education } from '../data/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who Aaron Scott is: food industry professional with a background in politics and sales.">
  <article class="prose about">
    <span class="kicker">About</span>
    <h1>About Aaron</h1>
    <p class="tagline">{profile.tagline}</p>

    <p>I started at Qdoba as a server and advanced through every role in the restaurant: cook, shift supervisor, assistant GM, GM, then brand operations and new restaurant opening trainer. That is where I learned the two methods that still guide my work: the Toyota Production System and Training Within Industry job instruction. Identify the waste, standardize the work, and train it until it holds without supervision.</p>

    <p>I am currently the Multi-Unit General Manager for two Freddy's Frozen Custard &amp; Steakburgers locations, and I lead <a href={url('projects/backhouse-group/')}>Backhouse Group</a>, the parent company for my ventures and my operations consulting practice.</p>

    <p>My background extends beyond restaurants. I hold a degree in political science from {education.school}, with minors in policy studies and global security and diplomacy. I have coordinated phone banks, interned for a county party, co-authored policy research, and sold subscriptions, donations and catering contracts, door to door and business to business. Politics trained me to diagnose where systems fail; sales taught me that a solution only matters if people adopt it.</p>

    <blockquote class="pull">
      <p>“It was a constant wondering if the agent could complete the task, and when it did we asked, what else?”</p>
      <cite>On building the inventory agent at Bang Cookies</cite>
    </blockquote>

    <p>I also build software and AI systems, using agents to handle repetitive work so people can focus on improvement. At Bang Cookies that meant an inventory agent that saved a full workday every week. Independently, I have built a <a href={url('projects/trade-bot/')}>trading agent</a>, an iPhone app, a restaurant game and an AI-run media channel. Each <a href={url('projects/')}>project page</a> states its current status.</p>

    <p>Through <a href={url('projects/drbreakdown/')}>drBreakdown</a>, my YouTube channel, I explain why institutions and systems break down, beginning with politics and policy.</p>

    <h2>Principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Diagnose before prescribing.</strong> Assess the full operation before changing any part of it.</li>
      <li><strong>Train leaders alongside their teams.</strong> Every store retraining I led included its General Manager.</li>
      <li><strong>Report status accurately.</strong> Completed, in progress and planned work are always labeled as such.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Outside of work</h2>
    <p>I read widely across politics, history, science and business.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
